        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. Paul Boehmer, John McTiernan, Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, Denis Leary\n- Works: Star Trek, The Thomas Crown Affair, The Good German\n- Topics: American actors, films, remakes\n\nFacts:\n- J. Paul Boehmer was born on October 30, 1965, and he is an American actor.\n- J. Paul Boehmer is best known for numerous appearances in the Star Trek universe.\n- The Thomas Crown Affair is a 1999 American heist film directed by John McTiernan.\n- The 1999 film The Thomas Crown Affair stars Pierce Brosnan, Rene Russo, and Denis Leary.\n- The 1999 film The Thomas Crown Affair is a remake of the 1968 film of the same name.\n- J. Paul Boehmer's other screen appearances include The Thomas Crown Affair and The Good German.",
